{"version":1,"content":"<p>51歲的藝人黃浩然由電影圈再跳進電視台無綫，拍攝過《果欄中的江湖大嫂》、《多功能老婆》及《法證先鋒IV》等劇集，現為古天樂旗下藝人的他，其太太莫家嘉（Kaka）被指家族顯赫，在娛圈中有「億萬駙馬」之稱。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&amp;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T06:23:59.651766+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T06:01:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T06:17:17.608143+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T06:17:17.608143+00:00","content_hash":"a0c96f22dc84e5f1e9c389447e9afa45b4874f52b25adde15eda8f3a5926d890","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}